# QA Summary Report

## Project Name
QA Testing ETL Validation Framework

## Testing Objective
Validate the accuracy, completeness, and reliability of transformed transaction data before dashboard or reporting usage.

## Testing Scope

- Functional Testing
- Regression Testing
- Database Testing
- Data Validation
- Business User Acceptance Testing UAT
- Basic Selenium UI Testing
- Defect Tracking

## Key QA Metrics

| Metric | Result |
|---|---|
| Test Cases Designed | 30+ validation scenarios considered |
| Automated Pytest Checks | 6 core regression checks |
| Critical Defects Simulated | 5 JIRA-style defects |
| Data Accuracy Improvement | 25% simulated improvement |
